  Dialogue:
  - Time: 0
    Dialogue:
    - '[patterns="1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9"][auto="0"]'
  - Time: 100
    Dialogue:
    - '[patterns="0"][s="you"]...'
    - '[s="gloria"]Oh, sweetheart!!! How are you still standing?'
    - '[s="you"]you sound disappointed by that, gloria.'
    - '[s="gloria"]Disappointed?? Oh no darling, FAR from the truth! I haven''t had
      an audience this engaged in one of my performances in YEARS!'
    - '[s="gloria"]Oh, how silly of me! You are NOT my audience at all, darling...'
    - '[s="gloria"]YOU''RE MY LEADING CO-STAR!!!'
    - '[s="gloria"]Although, between you and me...'
    - '[s="gloria"]Your footwork could use a little work... you keep missing your
      cues'
    - '[s="you"]are you ever going to shut up?'
    - '[s="gloria"]If I stopped talking, you''d only have yourself to listen to... 
      how incredibly BORING!'
    - '[s="gloria"]Anyways sweetpea, you know how the show goes.'
    - '[s="gloria"]The lights, the music, the screaming... and that dreadful little
      voice in your head, ME, telling you that you are going to flop your performance
      like a fish.'
    - '[s="you"]you''re insufferable.'
    - '[s="gloria"]Now, I do hope you''ve enjoyed the intermission!'
    - '[s="you"]We''re in the middle of your song STILL?!'
    - '[s="gloria"]I KNOW!'
    - '[s="gloria"]Now, EVERYBODY!!! give our little star a BIG round of applause!
      A total A FOR EFFORT!!!'
    - '[s="gloria"]...You hear that?! I hear the people insisting on an ENCOREEEEE!!!'
    - '[s="gloria"]HOW DELIGHTFUL!!!'
    - '[patterns="10,11,12"][s="gloria"]PLACES, DARLING!!! LET''S MAKE A BLOODY MESS
      OF THINGS!!!'
